#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""live-gallery: watch folders recursively and show new images and 3D models in a
browser the moment they appear, newest first, no matter how deeply nested.

    live-gallery [DIR ...] [--port 8765] [--initial 150] [-x DIRNAME] [--poll] [--open]

Standard library only. Uses Linux inotify (instant, idle when nothing changes); falls back
to polling every --interval seconds elsewhere or with --poll. 3D previews load three.js from a CDN inside the browser.
"""
